WEBVTT

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:15.270
Welcome to Chocoimo's room.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:20.710
Only a strong Chocobo accepted
by the Ciel Monolith

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:33.690
can become the legendary Ciel Chocobo.

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:38.320
At least, that's the rumor.

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:10.160
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:10.160
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:17.670
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:17.670
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:26.770
With our eyes on the future

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:26.770
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:32.880
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:32.880
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:42.520
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:42.520
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:50.030
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:50.030
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:55.740
Fly to the Neverland

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:55.740
Fly to the Neverland

00:01:55.810 --> 00:02:05.240
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:01:55.810 --> 00:02:05.240
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:18.130
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:02:20.270 --> 00:02:24.070
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:28.740
The man of mushrooms, his name is...

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:40.690
What? This is Omega?!

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.050
It's so small!

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:48.660
Omega possesses a monstrous urge to destroy.

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:53.500
If that urge is quelled,
he turns into a form like that,

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:56.960
and awaits the time when he can
once again awaken.

00:02:58.270 --> 00:03:01.330
We've got that one to start off with.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:05.670
No, make that two.

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:07.840
Good job finding it, Herba!

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:13.320
I used three thousand of my Cac baby servants,

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:15.120
and they finally found this.

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:19.330
But...

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:24.890
In the process, about 2,990 of them
were melted by Omega's aura.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.190
Stop wasting our time!

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:30.760
What?!

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:34.670
I apologize for the wait, Your Excellency!

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:43.910
In the ocean regions, I was easily able
to secure an Omega crystal.

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:46.110
Wow, you guys all did a pretty good job.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:49.720
Makenshi baby!

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:52.730
Wow!

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:55.530
Oh, it's so big!

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:01.390
I never expected a competition in size.

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:06.200
I knew I could always count on you, Makenshi!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.470
From now on you'll be one of
the Five Lords of Gaudium.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:11.510
My thanks.

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:13.810
Truly impressive.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:16.840
Yeah, you got the best deal out of this.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:24.350
Well, well, it appears Lord Fungus
has returned as well.

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:27.860
Fungus, where's your piece of Omega?

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:34.160
I am still currently searching,
but I have yet to make a find.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:36.760
Even though everyone else found one?

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:39.570
Please forgive me!

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:42.200
This is really no good, Fungus baby.

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:44.700
Too bad for you, Fungus baby.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:51.790
Fungus, you can't defeat the Black Wind,

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:54.190
and you can't even find any of Omega.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:55.520
I'm quite disappointed.

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:58.620
You understand what this means
now, don't you?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.460
If you make me mad...

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:06.160
I can be really scary!

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:28.390
Good morning, Lisa.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:29.950
Good morning.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.720
Lisa, did you sleep?

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:33.560
A little bit.

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:38.660
I've never seen you asleep, Lisa.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:41.130
I'm fine.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:43.830
You're going to get really tired
if you keep this up.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:49.440
One must try with all their might
to help out others.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:52.510
That's the way I was taught.

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:54.550
Thank you, Lisa.

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:02.450
I'm sorry, Chobi, did we wake you up?

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:07.750
Are you sure you'll be fine
just being with us, Chobi?

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.660
Good morning.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:14.700
Ai?

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:18.400
I'm so hungry.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:25.350
Stop it!

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:27.750
He seems happy, after all.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.390
I wonder if this is the way
he expresses affection?

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:35.020
There's no way that you can be
the Ciel chocobo!

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:43.130
I've got to give it all I've got and accomplish
my duties for His Excellency's sake.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:49.500
Lord Fungus...

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:54.500
Just the man I wanted to see.

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.240
What do you want?!

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:59.770
Crux has discovered a place

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:05.220
that will greatly increase your power.

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:09.650
Greatly increase my power?

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:10.920
Yes...

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.410
<i>White Cloud...</i>

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:37.320
<i>Omega... No...</i>

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:45.390
<i>My enemy is the White Cloud, Makenshi.</i>

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:56.560
Oh, this is exactly the same as my hometown!

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:59.240
Identical in every detail!

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:05.700
Yes, that is correct. This is your
hometown, Lord Fungus.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:07.110
What did you say?!

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:12.350
Long ago, when your world was
consumed by Chaos,

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:16.450
a part of it was also taken in by Wonderland.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:19.920
So that is what really happened?!

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:22.930
Oh, Oscha, thank you so much
for finding this place for me!

00:08:23.030 --> 00:08:25.000
I owe you big time!

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:29.890
It's been so long!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:34.070
Being the sole survivor, I trusted
His Excellency, the Earl,

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:38.240
with hope to see my dreams come true
and my world restored.

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:53.520
I can feel my ambitions of long ago
being resurrected once again!

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:57.190
Oscha, give His Excellency, the Earl,
this message for me.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:01.300
Fungus, one of the Four Lords of Gaudium,

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:04.570
will restore his home world once again.

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:07.200
And with this great increase in power,

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:12.080
I vow we will succeed in acquiring Omega!

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:16.670
As you wish. Everything is for
His Excellency's sake.

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:37.260
What is this place? It stinks like mold!

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:39.070
This place is nothing but mushrooms.

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:42.470
We're too high up here, we can't get down!

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:44.070
You're right.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:45.440
What should we do, Lisa?

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:24.620
This is amazing!

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:28.390
You really are the legendary Ciel chocobo.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.420
Even though all you can do is fly.

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:32.190
Thanks, Chobi!

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:46.000
Doesn't something smell good here?

00:10:47.240 --> 00:10:50.440
I'm not sure what it is, but it
sure does smell delicious.

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:53.310
Chobi said he smells it too.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:56.680
I'm so hungry!

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:01.180
Be careful, it seems like that smell
is coming from the mushrooms.

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:02.880
Ai!

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:14.000
There's something on me! It's all over me!

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:12.200
Sis!

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:14.000
Ai! Calm down!

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:28.110
What are you jokers doing here?!

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:31.180
If you've got a problem,
take it up with the Subway!

00:11:34.990 --> 00:11:35.980
Kaze!

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:40.090
All right! Come on, Mister, hurry up
and take care of that chump!

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:44.490
Black Wind, why are you also here?!

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:50.430
I'm going to kill you!

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.280
<i>This is weird.</i>

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:58.480
<i>Something about this place is different
than any other place we've been to.</i>

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.540
<i>Something is...</i>

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:12.060
I am busy preparing to restore my world.

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:19.060
You guys showing up to disturb me in this
important endeavor is utterly unacceptable!

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:24.530
This spot will soon be your graveyard!

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:27.010
Graveyard...

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:38.050
Everyone, let's get to a safe place!

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:48.960
You should know by now that an attack
like that won't faze me in the least.

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:51.930
What's wrong?! Break out the Magun!

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:59.400
This is the homeland of my soul!

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:02.370
Every last thing here exists on my behalf.

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:07.410
You will learn that everything here
exists to give me power!

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:13.580
Hardness Bacillus... Inhale!

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:24.830
He's getting bigger!

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.270
That guy is bad news!

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:33.700
Take this!

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:39.100
Kaze!

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.200
Mister!

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:45.450
You are not one to be defeated so easily!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:46.780
Get back up!

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:51.820
All of these spores and hyphae floating
in the air are fighting with him?!

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:55.860
Soil is my power!

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:23.050
The Magun has thawed!

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:31.020
That's it, that's the way it should be!

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:37.400
Now, fire, if you think you can defeat
me and my immortal body!

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:43.100
The appropriate Soil to use
against you has been decided!

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:50.410
The sleep that wraps death,
Steel Gray!

00:14:56.490 --> 00:15:01.190
Bubbling and boiling blood,
Heat Crimson!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:10.160
And finally, the light that penetrates
darkness, Lightning Yellow!

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:31.960
Howl! I summon you, Ixion!

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:08.790
Are you sure? Are you sure?

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:15.030
I have faced him once before,
can it really defeat me?

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:25.230
Did it work?

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:27.840
He's not going to die that easily!

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.870
No!

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.830
Thanks, Chobi!

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:05.650
I would never walk into a fight
that I did not think I could win!

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:13.790
My body is tingling all over, and it feels great!

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:18.900
Every last thing here moves as I will it.

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:23.730
So you see, my biggest weapon
of all is this place itself!

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.380
Don't take it personally!

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:36.240
This is all for the sake of His Excellency.

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:38.110
Kaze!

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:42.750
Mister! Just give up and run away!

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:49.120
It has been decided that this is the
appropriate graveyard for you.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:53.570
No, you are the appropriate one
to enter a graveyard!

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:58.260
What are you talking about?!

00:17:58.370 --> 00:17:59.860
Kaze...

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.070
He's not giving up in the least.

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:06.570
The origin of all things,
Mother Black!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:16.880
A heat that will scorch all things,
Fire Red!

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:26.160
And finally, the critical point of
everything, Burning Gold!

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:32.600
You imbecile!

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:35.560
Anything you do to me will end up
with the same fruitless results!

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:40.380
Burn! I summon you, Phoenix!

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:03.460
What?!

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:08.240
The tingling from before has combined
with the burning of this one!

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:12.110
This might be too hot!

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.760
It looks like it all burned up!

00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:38.030
Incredible!

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:40.160
To think it destroyed everything...

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:46.510
Not so fast!

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:50.340
That voice!

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:51.680
It can't be.

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:08.890
No way!

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:14.970
Whew, I thought I was going to die!

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:19.070
This land is indestructible!

00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:22.620
And I'm going to kill you!

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:37.830
How could this be?

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.430
What a horrifying flow of energy!

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:42.620
I knew it, this place must be...

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:45.030
Super bad news.

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
I am so thirsty

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
It's really getting bad

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
Taihen nan desu

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
My heart skipped a beat

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
It's just like torture

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
Goumon no you desu

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
I can't take it

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
Taekirenai desu

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.970
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.970
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.490
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.490
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Please, God

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Douka kamisama

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
You are now the only person

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
That my eyes can see

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
Kimi shika utsuranai

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Kitai wa kore kara

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
Nani kara nani made omoikitchatte

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
Sa subete wo butsukeyou

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Nobody knows the right answer

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Seikai wa dare ni mo wakanai ai ai ai ai

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
Atama no naka de wa mou

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
On the inside

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
Shukufuku no kurakkaa

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Something is going to start

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Nani ka ga hajimaru

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Kitai wa kore kara

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Nozomi wo mochimashou

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:19.520
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.370 --> 00:22:24.840
I cannot give a prophecy.

00:22:26.040 --> 00:22:30.100
Is there any Summon that can
defeat the immortal Fungus?!

00:22:30.880 --> 00:22:34.080
Even Makenshi, the White Cloud,

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:36.110
will now launch an attack against
the Black Wind.

00:22:40.990 --> 00:22:43.850
Next time, I'll return to offer you
my Unlimited guidance.
